    "detailed_description": "Being on your guard will become second nature in Veneficium, a survival-horror game developed by a passionate team. Play as Abigail Vandran, a witch who has only one goal in mind: to find her grandmother Willow and escape a forest of death... Only if she survives the wrath of the demons lurking in the mist.<br><br><strong>\u26e7 \ud835\ude10\ud835\ude2e\ud835\ude2e\ud835\ude26\ud835\ude33\ud835\ude34\ud835\ude2a\ud835\ude37\ud835\ude26 \ud835\ude0c\ud835\ude39\ud835\ude31\ud835\ude26\ud835\ude33\ud835\ude2a\ud835\ude26\ud835\ude2f\ud835\ude24\ud835\ude26:</strong> Explore a realistic environment set deep in the woods, filled with hair-raising sounds that are sure to hold you spellbound.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1532170/extras/dda102d226e7bc7f36a3022d3a24bb01.poster.avif?t=1698691035\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1532170/extras/dda102d226e7bc7f36a3022d3a24bb01.webm?t=1698691035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1532170/extras/dda102d226e7bc7f36a3022d3a24bb01.mp4?t=1698691035\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>\u26e7 \ud835\ude1a\ud835\ude35\ud835\ude26\ud835\ude22\ud835\ude2d\ud835\ude35\ud835\ude29:</strong> Be careful where you step and use your environment to your advantage in escaping unpredictable enemies, or it may cost you your life.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1532170/extras/b2699f4a90496bcf668a18946f28753b.poster.avif?t=1698691035\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1532170/extras/b2699f4a90496bcf668a18946f28753b.webm?t=1698691035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1532170/extras/b2699f4a90496bcf668a18946f28753b.mp4?t=1698691035\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>\u26e7 \ud835\ude0e\ud835\ude2d\ud835\ude30\ud835\ude30\ud835\ude2e\ud835\ude3a \ud835\ude08\ud835\ude35\ud835\ude2e\ud835\ude30\ud835\ude34\ud835\ude31\ud835\ude29\ud835\ude26\ud835\ude33\ud835\ude26:</strong> Find your way in foggy surroundings strewed with trees and mysterious locations, with your lantern as your only light. Step upon traces of dark and wicked practices that will chill you to the bone.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1532170/extras/4a0d3e703885b2216766448e0f8f14a9.poster.avif?t=1698691035\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1532170/extras/4a0d3e703885b2216766448e0f8f14a9.webm?t=1698691035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1532170/extras/4a0d3e703885b2216766448e0f8f14a9.mp4?t=1698691035\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>\u26e7 \ud835\ude1a\ud835\ude31\ud835\ude26\ud835\ude2d\ud835\ude2d\ud835\ude24\ud835\ude22\ud835\ude34\ud835\ude35\ud835\ude2a\ud835\ude2f\ud835\ude28:</strong> Gather ingredients and create spells from your book of shadows that will help you escape your enemy's notice.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1532170/extras/4926c80dca974f0e08a33777d038fa8c.poster.avif?t=1698691035\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1532170/extras/4926c80dca974f0e08a33777d038fa8c.webm?t=1698691035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1532170/extras/4926c80dca974f0e08a33777d038fa8c.mp4?t=1698691035\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
